        <p>By accessing or using Roovia — whether to browse listings, book a stay, or host a property — you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions, our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, and any additional guidelines referenced here. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the platform.</p>
