          <li><strong>"Host"</strong> — a user who lists a property for booking on Roovia.</li>
          <li><strong>"Guest"</strong> — a user who books a stay through Roovia.</li>
          <li><strong>"Listing"</strong> — a property page created by a Host describing a home available for booking.</li>
          <li><strong>"Booking"</strong> — a confirmed reservation of a Listing for specified dates.</li>
          <li><strong>"Platform"</strong> — the Roovia website, mobile experience, and related services.</li>
        </ul>
