      <div class="legal-section" id="eligibility">
        <h2><span class="legal-num">03</span> Eligibility & Account Registration</h2>
        <p>To use Roovia you must register an account with accurate, current information. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials and for all activity under your account.</p>
