        <h2><span class="legal-num">04</span> Bookings & Reservations</h2>
        <p>A booking is confirmed only once payment has been successfully processed and a confirmation is issued through the Platform. Availability, pricing, and house rules shown at the time of booking form part of your agreement with the Host.</p>
        <p>Roovia acts as an intermediary connecting Guests and Hosts; the underlying contract for the stay is between the Guest and the Host, subject to these Terms.</p>
      </div>

