        <h2><span class="legal-num">05</span> Payments, Fees & Commission</h2>
        <p>All payments on Roovia are processed securely through Razorpay. Guests are charged the full listing price plus any applicable service fee at the time of booking. Hosts receive their payout, net of Roovia's commission, after the guest's check-in date, subject to our standard payout schedule.</p>
        <p>Roovia does not store your card or bank details — these are handled entirely by our payment processor in compliance with applicable data security standards.</p>
      </div>

