        <h2><span class="legal-num">06</span> Cancellation & Refund Policy</h2>
        <p>Refunds depend on the cancellation policy attached to the Listing you booked. Roovia supports three policy tiers, selected by the Host at the time of listing:</p>
        <table class="legal-table">
