            <tr><td><strong>Flexible</strong></td><td>24+ hours before check-in</td><td>—</td><td>Within 24 hours</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Moderate</strong></td><td>5+ days before check-in</td><td>50% · 1–5 days before</td><td>Within 24 hours</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Strict</strong></td><td>—</td><td>50% · 7+ days before</td><td>Within 7 days</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="legal-callout">Refunds are calculated automatically based on the time remaining until check-in and are credited to your original payment method within 5–7 business days.</div>
      </div>

